  "releaseNotes": "Adds proleptic-Gregorian date arithmetic to XsDate and XsDateTime (AddMonths/AddDays/Add), computing correctly for years at and below 1 (including year 0 and negative years) via the ExtendedYear carrier instead of overflowing .NET's DateOnly/DateTimeOffset floor at year 1. Additive; no existing behavior changes, no public API removed. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
